  "label": "Stigmatization of Low Test Scores",
  "description": "The meme perpetuates the stigmatization of individuals who score poorly on standardized tests, implying they are inferior or unworthy. This is a real-world social phenomenon where low test scores are often used to judge a person's intelligence or capability, which can be demeaning and contribute to negative self-perception.",
